WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.554
Every great stay begins with a key.

2
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.820
Marc has six.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.334
Meet Marc. Host. Hero. Towel folder.

4
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.870
Two flats in Barcelona. One sleeps twelve.

5
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.983
The train to Sitges runs on time.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Usually.

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.370
Marc is already there.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.941
With four flats by the sea.

9
00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:34.339
Real light. Real terraces.
Real towels, folded by hand.

10
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.800
Six flats, two cities, one Marc.

11
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.960
Guests call him wonderful.

12
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.898
He greets them in Barcelona and Sitges.

13
00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:45.870
Sometimes at the same time.

14
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:50.400
Next year brings carnival, a
phone congress, and zombies.

15
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.770
Merca Stay.

16
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.550
Your key to Barcelona and Sitges.
